  "CYP3A4 inhibition; hypotension risk",
  "Amlodipine modestly inhibits CYP3A4, raising simvastatin exposure and myopathy risk. Management: cap simvastatin at 20 mg/day with amlodipine or switch to rosuvastatin.",
  "amoxicillin reduces MTX tubular secretion; level rise. Management: monitor CBC and mucositis during co-use, especially high-dose MTX.",
  "amoxicillin+clavulanic acid reduces MTX tubular secretion; level rise. Management: monitor CBC and mucositis during co-use, especially high-dose MTX.",
