  "aripiprazole blocks central dopamine D2 receptors and can antagonize levodopa+carbidopa benefit or worsen parkinsonism. Management: avoid dopamine-blocking antiemetics/antipsychotics in parkinsonism; if psychosis needs treatment, use pimavanserin-class or lowest-dose quetiapine under specialist direction.",
