  "cotrimoxazole inhibits CYP2C9, the main clearance path of acenocoumarol; exposure and anticoagulant/anticonvulsant effect rise within days. Management: INR (for warfarin/acenocoumarol) or phenytoin levels before co-prescription; reduce dose 25-50%, monitor for bleeding or nystagmus/ataxia; avoid the combination when an alternative antimicrobial exists.",
