  "fluconazole inhibits CYP2C9-mediated sulfonylurea metabolism, raising glibenclamide exposure and hypoglycemia risk. Management: warn on hypoglycemia symptoms, consider halving the sulfonylurea dose, self-monitor glucose more often during co-treatment.",
