  "imipramine and tramadol both increase central serotonergic tone; risk of serotonin syndrome (agitation, tremor, hyperreflexia, hyperthermia, autonomic instability). Management: avoid the combination; if unavoidable start low, watch for early syndrome signs in the first 2 weeks, stop the serotonergic agent and support symptomatically if it develops.",
